      "content": "hey i have a really bad sinus infection and my head is pounding. i'm currently on lisinopril for my blood pressure (i'm at stage 2 so it's a bit high usually) but i really need something for my congestion. is it okay if i take some sudafed to clear it up? i just need to get some sleep",
